# Keep the build context to source + manifests. Host-installed dependencies,
# build output and local env files must never reach the image: a
# packages/frontend/.env* copied in would bake VITE_* values into the bundle.
**/node_modules
**/.vite
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.vercel
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
.claude
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
docs
